  "description": "Flynn Estate Agents have pleasure in bringing 198 Sutton Park to the sales market. A beautifully presented 4 bedroomed family home, which offers light filled accommodation, with the accommodation extending to c. 130sq.m. This welcoming home has 3 reception rooms, 4 double bedrooms and is complimented by a generous sized rear garden and a cobblelock driveway to front offering off street parking. Sutton Park is a very popular residential enclave with an excellent choice of schools and sports clubs in the vicinity. There are transport links provided by DART and buses on the coast road and a choice of shopping centres, neighbourhood restaurants and coffee shops. Viewing of no. 198 is highly recommended to appreciate this wonderful property. \n\nSutton Park offers coastal living, less than 10 minutes walk to coastal promenade, cycle track and walkway offering breathtaking views over Dublin Bay to Dublin Mountains. The house is well served by commuter DART and bus links providing access to the Dublin City Centre. This family friendly neighbourhood has a wide range of local amenities; schools primary/secondary, childcare facilities close by, shopping centres, restaurants, coffee shops and many sports clubs tennis, golf and water sport clubs.\n\nAccommodation\nPorch Entrance\nPVC front door & screen.\n\nReception Hall\nSolid oak flooring.\n\nDownstairs wc & whb\nFully tiled.\n\nLounge - 4.39m (14'5\") x 3.64m (11'11\")\nTiled fireplace. Solid oak flooring. Double doors to:-\n\nDining Room - 4.35m (14'3\") x 3.63m (11'11\")\nSolid oak flooring.\n\nKitchen - 5.15m (16'11\") x 2.38m (7'10\")\nExtensive range of newly fitted press units. Plumbed for washing machine & dishwasher. Tiled floor.\n\nFamily Room - 5.09m (16'8\") x 3.33m (10'11\")\nCast iron fireplace with timber surround. Hotpress with insulated immersion tank. Recessed lighting. PVC door to rear.\n\nLanding\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.35m (14'3\") x 3.67m (12'0\")\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.37m (14'4\") x 3.43m (11'3\")\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.33m (10'11\") x 2.63m (8'8\")\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.79m (9'2\") x 2.61m (8'7\")\n\nShower room\nWalk in shower with electric shower, screen, whb and wc. Fully tiled. Heated towel rail.\n\n Property Reference :SuR319",
